OL,3,AMillions of people to see average      
OL,4,Amonthly mortgage payments rise by #100 
OL,6,FMore people face higher mortgage       
OL,7,Frepayments when they roll off a fixed  
OL,8,Fdeal than previously estimated, new    
OL,9,Ffigures from the the Bank of England   
OL,10,Fshow.                                  
OL,12,FAbout 6.5 million owners are forecast  
OL,13,Fto see their monthly repayment jump by 
OL,14,F#100 on average when they move onto    
OL,15,Ftheir next deal by the end of 2029, new
OL,16,Fdata in its Financial Stability Report 
OL,17,Freveals.                               
OL,19,FThat is more the double the #45-a-month
OL,20,Fhike that the Bank estimated in its    
OL,21,Flast report in July.                   
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
