OL,3,AMillions of people to see average      
OL,4,Amonthly mortgage payments rise by #100 
OL,6,FIn the shorter term, about one million 
OL,7,Fof those homeowners, who are on        
OL,8,Fmortgage rates below 3% and due to     
OL,9,Frefinance by the end of next year, will
OL,10,Fsee an average #200 increase in their  
OL,11,Fmonthly repayments.                    
